<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Claimdesk — technical demo</title>
<style>
:root{--blue:#3182F6;--ink:#191F28;--sub:#4E5968;--mute:#8B95A1;--soft:#F2F4F6;--line:#E5E8EB}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:24px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif}
section{display:none;position:absolute;inset:0;padding:48px 72px 110px;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}section.on{display:flex}
.k{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}h2{font-size:38px;margin:8px 0 14px}
pre{background:#0F1720;color:#E6EDF3;border-radius:16px;padding:18px 22px;font:15.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;overflow:hidden;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:19px}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}th{color:var(--mute);font-size:15px}
.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:16px;color:var(--sub)}
.row{display:flex;gap:20px}.card{flex:1;background:var(--soft);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;font-size:19px}.card b{display:block;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px}
</style></head><body>
@@DYNAMIC@@<section id="d4"><div class="k">Tempo features used</div><div class="row"><div class="card"><b>Batched calls</b>approve + N × fund in one transaction (≈566k gas per award; 2 slots)</div><div class="card"><b>Fee payer</b>relay co-signs fees; winner holds no balance</div><div class="card"><b>WebAuthn accounts</b>passkey = account; Account.fromWebAuthnP256</div><div class="card"><b>TIP-20 memos + fee tokens</b>award ref on every transfer; account page pays fees in the stablecoin</div></div></section>
@@D5@@<section id="d6"><div class="k">Organizer console — expected address from the paperwork, never from the chain</div><div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start"><img src="../ui/organizer-mismatch-dialog-1280.png" style="width:62%;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line)"><div class="card"><b>Mismatch blocks clearing</b>The paperwork names one account, the link registered another → red banner, Clear disabled, “New link”.<br><br><b>Local only</b>loopback · Host allow-list · session token. Paperwork note stays local; salted hash on-chain.</div></div></section>
<section id="d7"><div class="k">Winner — receipt and moving the money on</div><div class="row" style="justify-content:center;gap:28px"><img src="../ui/4-paid-receipt-390.png" style="height:520px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line)"><img src="../ui/6-sent-390.png" style="height:520px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line)"></div></section>
<script>function show(){const id=(location.hash||'#d1').slice(1);document.querySelectorAll('section').forEach(s=>s.classList.toggle('on',s.id===id))}addEventListener('hashchange',show);show()</script>
</body></html>